She looks like she
stepped in poo.

1207
01:45:13,665 --> 01:45:15,764
Defendant please rise.

1208
01:45:18,306 --> 01:45:21,736
They postponed my trial until after
the Olympics.

1209
01:45:22,852 --> 01:45:26,732
Tonya Harding. You are hereby
sentenced to 3 years probation...

1210
01:45:27,360 --> 01:45:32,383
$100,000 fine plus $10,000 to the
DA's office for special costs.

1211
01:45:33,492 --> 01:45:37,112
Another $50,000 to set up a fund for
the Special Olympics.

1212
01:45:37,672 --> 01:45:42,471
500 hours community service;
a psychological evaluation.

1213
01:45:43,839 --> 01:45:48,066
And your immediate resignation from
the US Figure Skating Association.

1214
01:45:48,509 --> 01:45:55,360
Banning you for life from all Figure Skating
Association competitions and events.

1215
01:45:58,056 --> 01:45:59,198
So ordered.

1216
01:46:00,159 --> 01:46:01,252
No..

1217
01:46:03,313 --> 01:46:06,568
All I did was the hindering
of prosecution.

1218
01:46:09,030 --> 01:46:11,044
- What? You'll never...
- It will be OK.

1219
01:46:12,215 --> 01:46:17,085
You're never gonna let me
skate again?

1220
01:46:17,961 --> 01:46:20,748
I'd rather do jail time.
Please...

1221
01:46:22,018 --> 01:46:23,945
They only got 18 months.

1222
01:46:24,832 --> 01:46:27,592
They got 18 months. I will do that.

1223
01:46:28,919 --> 01:46:30,013
You can't...

1224
01:46:33,749 --> 01:46:40,285
Your Honor. I don't have an education.
All I know is skating.

1225
01:46:40,826 --> 01:46:45,565
- That's all I know.
- And I... I'm no one...

1226
01:46:46,471 --> 01:46:48,815
- If I can't skate...
- It's okay.

1227
01:46:49,561 --> 01:46:53,415
- I'm not... I mean, I'm not some monster.
- Mrs. Harding?

1228
01:46:53,494 --> 01:46:57,924
I just... I'm trying to do the
best in what I know how to.

1229
01:46:57,933 --> 01:46:58,951
- Mrs. Harding?
- You're give me a...

1230
01:46:58,975 --> 01:47:00,648
It's like you are giving
me a life sentence.

1231
01:47:00,672 --> 01:47:03,031
- You can't... do that.
- Mrs. Harding, that's enough.

1232
01:47:03,101 --> 01:47:04,529
You can't... please.

1233
01:47:04,685 --> 01:47:08,954
Please! Just send me to jail
and then I can still skate!

1234
01:47:09,407 --> 01:47:11,197
Just send me to jail and
then I can still skate...!

1235
01:47:11,221 --> 01:47:12,589
I... I've given you my decision.

1236
01:47:14,709 --> 01:47:15,751
Thank you, Your Honor.

1237
01:47:19,224 --> 01:47:22,414
Listen to me... it's
the best we can get.

1238
01:47:22,596 --> 01:47:26,761
The 10 best questions
Connie Chung asked Tonya Harding earlier.

1239
01:47:27,163 --> 01:47:32,017
No.10: "Would you walk through the
metal detector, one more time, please?"

1240
01:47:33,182 --> 01:47:36,066
No. 9: "Do you think
you could kick my ass?"

1241
01:47:59,412 --> 01:48:03,608
I got a 2 year sentence.
And did 8 months to the day.

1242
01:48:06,439 --> 01:48:10,798
All that craziness, you know,
everything I'll ever be known for,

1243
01:48:11,034 --> 01:48:15,953
was only a few months
from start to finish.

1244
01:48:16,954 --> 01:48:21,321
I got up one morning before I went to jail,
and the press was leaving.

1245
01:48:22,858 --> 01:48:24,523
Like I dreamed of.

1246
01:48:39,769 --> 01:48:43,076
I never see Tonya anymore and this is fine.
I could care less.

1247
01:48:44,544 --> 01:48:47,207
I lead a full life...
very happy.

1248
01:48:53,569 --> 01:48:58,624
Tonya... I would never have
thought of calling in a death threat.

1249
01:49:00,298 --> 01:49:01,443
And...

1250
01:49:02,556 --> 01:49:07,765
I was too caught up in all the terrible
things she was saying about me...

1251
01:49:09,469 --> 01:49:12,386
rather than the fact that I...

1252
01:49:15,439 --> 01:49:17,284
Completely ruined her career.

1253
01:49:23,958 --> 01:49:25,573
Absolutely ruined it.

1254
01:49:28,224 --> 01:49:30,097
Once I was banned from figure

1255
01:49:30,197 --> 01:49:35,600
from figure skating for life, I did
not have a lot of options.

1256
01:49:36,918 --> 01:49:41,371
Did what I had to do to just stay in the
public eye and pay the bills.

1257
01:49:42,960 --> 01:49:48,637
I was the second most known person
behind Bill Clinton in the world.

1258
01:49:50,107 --> 01:49:55,529
That meant something.
The people still wanted to see me.

1259
01:49:57,816 --> 01:50:01,071
So I became a lady boxer.

1260
01:50:02,384 --> 01:50:06,837
I mean, why not? Violence was
always what I knew anyway.

1261
01:50:17,968 --> 01:50:20,103
America, you know...

1262
01:50:24,233 --> 01:50:26,655
They want someone to love...

1263
01:50:28,473 --> 01:50:30,597
but they want someone to hate.

1264
01:50:36,122 --> 01:50:37,841
And they want it easy.

1265
01:50:39,130 --> 01:50:40,523
But what's easy?

1266
01:50:43,095 --> 01:50:45,855
And the haters always say, Tonya

1267
01:50:46,964 --> 01:50:48,696
Tell the truth.

1268
01:50:50,986 --> 01:50:54,597
But there's no such thing as truth.
I mean it's bullshit.

1269
01:51:01,611 --> 01:51:04,239
Everyone has their own truth.

1270
01:51:04,473 --> 01:51:07,442
And life just does
whatever the fuck it wants.

1271
01:51:35,337 --> 01:51:37,445
That's the story on my life!

1272
01:51:40,904 --> 01:51:42,909
And that's the fucking truth!

1273
01:51:53,820 --> 01:51:58,955
